# ATS Update — 2026-09-04 RL Core Learning Fixes & Sanity Harness

## Summary
Fixed the reasons the PPO agent's reward curve never trended up, added a
fast deterministic smoke test that proves the learner learns, and disabled
the auto-growing network until the fixed-width policy is shown to work.
Full reasoning and the intended architecture are in
[`docs/architecture_and_reasoning_2026-09-04.md`](file:///c:/Users/Bob/Documents/github/ATS/docs/architecture_and_reasoning_2026-09-04.md).

